OL,3,ATeenager's hand blown off during
OL,4,Aconfrontation between France school
OL,5,Aprotesters and police
OL,6,
OL,7,FAround 500 schools were partially or
OL,8,Ftotally closed across the country on
OL,9,FMonday amid student protests over the
OL,10,Fcondition of school buildings and
OL,11,Fstaffing which have led to clashes with
OL,12,Fpolice in recent days.
